FaustBestiary: A silent Reunion sniper. Camouflage conceals him while Mephisto remains, and every third violet bolt punishes complacency.
MephistoBestiary: A medic leading his troops under covering fire. His medical bolts can be intercepted, but the dust they carry offers no kindness.
SupportBestiary: Reunion troops accompanying Faust and Mephisto. Possessed soldiers regenerate faster under their medic, while ballistae protect the sniper.
Impatient: The Reunion sniper has lost his patience.
ExecutionDeath: "{0} could not escape Faust's locked shot."
DustDeath: "{0} succumbed to Originium dust."
